@slhssb/dsh-advisor README · dsh-advisor：dsh has no built-in advisor; this plugin implements one on the standard
`agent/pre-step` waterfall (the same injection channel used by
`dsh-agent-instructions` and `dsh-compaction-basic`).

@slhssb/dsh-advisor README · Configuration：Disable entirely with `disabled: true` on the row, or set an empty
`provider`/`model` to fall back to the current request route (`agent/session`
request header, then agent options).
